c(43, "§8.1; part 8 #1", "must-never-break", "§8.1 immediate fix — a release that cannot break launch or the day rollover: staged rollout with crash-rate gating (201 reviews blame a specific update; single days with 49 reviews — a halted rollout would have contained 2016-11, 2017-10 and 2021-08-20); make 'start new day' (cron) idempotent and visible and never let a failed rollover block ticking tasks (BUG_RESET 93); fix tap targets that register on the wrong task and widget refresh (BUG_WIDGET 22).", "post-update crash waves; day-rollover failures", "1★-burst", "BUG_REGRESSION 201; BUG_RESET 93; BUG_WIDGET 22; 49-review day", "must-never-break", "High-priority", "generalisable", ["13838933613", "7712740288", "1835618625"], "", "")

